Hi Julien,

Looks like a bug. If you are able to email me (off-list) your fitted model object as an .Rds or .Rdata file, I can take a closer look.

I realize these are simulations, and you may have others with more sites and primary periods, but in general I would not attempt to fit a model with a single site like this. And if you only have one primary period, it would be better to fit the model with the simpler multinomPois() function.

Ken

